# Local read-only checkout for verifying the triple_stages_comfyui-graph pipeline
# against the real ComfyUI source. The Dockerfile clones ComfyUI fresh at build
# time (pinned by COMFYUI_SHA), so the local copy is dev-only / not shipped —
# same as LTX-2-ref/. (ComfyUI-ref/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-LTXVideo/ may be present
# locally for cross-referencing but is unused at runtime — core nodes only.)
